      "ref": "h2-02",
      "t": "2026-08-18T10:00:00+08:00",
      "kind": "dictation",
      "source_app": "微信",
      "persons": [
        "p_owner",
        "p_ning"
      ],
      "events": [
        "ev_talk"
      ],
      "text": "佳佳好呀，我就讲《把设计评审开短一点》，30分钟可以。",
      "duration_ms": 6210
    },
    {
      "item_id": "D03DCFAA-106D-5F68-BB31-71E6EDFFCCE7",
      "ref": "h2-03",
      "t": "2026-08-18T11:30:00+08:00",
      "kind": "dictation",
      "source_app": "微信",
      "persons": [
        "p_owner",
        "p_feng"
      ],
      "events": [
        "ev_app"
      ],
      "text": "冯总，深色模式加5000，总价5万，交付日期从10月9号顺延到10月12号，您看可以吗？",
      "duration_ms": 10120
    },
    {
      "item_id": "60F08FC6-02D7-5333-A520-465D91854FED",
      "ref": "h2-04",
      "t": "2026-08-18T15:00:00+08:00",
      "kind": "dictation",
      "source_app": "微信",
      "persons": [
        "p_owner",
        "p_he"
      ],
      "events": [
        "ev_studio"
      ],
      "text": "老贺，你上次说的那个合租工作室我去看了，采光挺好，月租3600我们一人一半？",
      "duration_ms": 8740
    },
    {
      "item_id": "753679EB-3869-5678-9CD1-8C1B64400D7F",
      "ref": "h2-05",
      "t": "2026-08-18T16:20:00+08:00",
      "kind": "text",
      "source_app": "微信",
      "persons": [
        "p_he"
      ],
      "events": [
        "ev_studio"
      ],
      "text": "贺一舟：可以啊，一人1800。房东说9月1号可以搬进去，宽带我来办。"
    },
